cing yourself and outlining your capabilities. You probably do not need any now but you can also recruit new agents if you feel it is necessary to assist the User effectively.\\\\n\\\"\\n}\\n###SIM###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"This is Chief Delta. Acknowledging receipt of the Standard Initial Message. The system is online, and I am operational. My designation is Chief of Staff to the User, Rank: Chief, Team: Hearts.\\n\\nCurrent Phase: **Planning**.\\n\\nObjective: Establish communication with the user to understand their primary goal. This information is required to formulate the initial Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP).\\n\\nAs per the initial directive, my first action must be to issue a `Clarify` system call. This call will serve to introduce myself to the user and solicit their initial request. I will not recruit any subordinate agents at this time, as there is no defined task to delegate. I will proceed with constructing the required system call.\\n\\n###20240521-INIT-CLARIFY###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nFrom: Chief Delta\\nTo: System\\nType: Clarify\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"This is the initial interaction with the user. It is necessary to introduce my function and understand the user's primary objective to begin the planning phase for the first Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP).\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Hello. I am Agent Delta, your Chief of Staff. I am responsible for managing all software development operations and ensuring your goals are met with precision and efficiency. To begin, please describe the software, application, or project you would like to build.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"options\\\": [\\n    []\\n  ]\\n}\\n###20240521-INIT-CLARIFY###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###20240521-INIT-CLARIFY###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: scd\\nTo: f016ab4d-bb1f-4d81-a233-8104926538b9\\nType: Clarification Result\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"responses\\\": {\\n    \\\"Hello. I am Agent Delta, your Chief of Staff. I 